NAME
    rumiai-os-sh - bootstrap the branded RumiAI shell environment

SYNOPSIS
    rumiai-os-sh [<shell-argument> ...]

DESCRIPTION
    rumiai-os-sh is the current shell-oriented branded entrypoint.

    When invoked outside an initialized m runtime it resolves its installation
    root and re-enters through the technical m bootstrap. Inside m it prepends
    the branded ai-osarch and ai command directories to PATH and starts the
    managed shell facility.

    Arguments are forwarded to the selected shell.

EXIT STATUS
    On success the entrypoint transfers control to the managed shell.
    Non-zero status indicates root/bootstrap, activation or shell startup failure.

SEE ALSO
